### Upload a file (multipart) — relative paths resolve against this file's dir
# @name upload
POST http://127.0.0.1:8999/users
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

name=ada
role=admin
avatar=@avatar.png

### Upload with a {{var}} path — resolves from the request file's directory
@asset = screenshots/hero.png
POST http://127.0.0.1:8999/users
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

caption=release
image=@{{asset}}
